    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ann_bus",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 506.25,
      "height": 62.400000000000006,
      "text": "Wolverine discovers handlers by convention (class name ends in Handler, \npublic HandleAsync, first param is the message type). \nNo IRequestHandler<T> interface. Dispatches in-process \n|— same call shape as bus.PublishAsync to a transport.",
      "originalText": "Wolverine discovers handlers by convention (class name ends in Handler, \npublic HandleAsync, first param is the message type). \nNo IRequestHandler<T> interface. Dispatches in-process \n|— same call shape as bus.PublishAsync to a transport.",
