    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ann_pipe",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 878.90625,
      "height": 140.4,
      "text": "(1) Validation: if any FluentValidation rule fails →\nValidationException → caught by GlobalExceptionHandler\n→ 400 ProblemDetails (per-field errors). Handler never runs.\n\n(2) Context propagation: opens logger.BeginScope so handler logs carry the correlation/user/session IDs. For async messages, \nthe IDs are restored from envelope headers.\n\n(3) AutoApplyTransactions: detects the handler uses a DbContext, opens a transaction. Entity write + outbox-row write commit \ntogether at the end of the handler — see Diagram 3.",
      "originalText": "(1) Validation: if any FluentValidation rule fails →\nValidationException → caught by GlobalExceptionHandler\n→ 400 ProblemDetails (per-field errors). Handler never runs.\n\n(2) Context propagation: opens logger.BeginScope so handler logs carry the correlation/user/session IDs. For async messages, \nthe IDs are restored from envelope headers.\n\n(3) AutoApplyTransactions: detects the handler uses a DbContext, opens a transaction. Entity write + outbox-row write commit \ntogether at the end of the handler — see Diagram 3.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 200065,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1897785388,
      "isDeleted": false,
