    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ann_handler",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 46.800000000000004,
      "text": "Constructor-injected dependencies: DbContext directly (no IFooRepository wrapper — DbContext IS Unit-of-Work, DbSet<T> IS Repository), IMessageBus, ICatalogClient (gRPC port — substituted in tests), ILogger.\nDomain methods enforce invariants (Order.Create, order.MarkAsPaid). Money is calculated server-side, never trusted from client.\nMay cascade events (return an event → Wolverine publishes via outbox).",
      "originalText": "Constructor-injected dependencies: DbContext directly (no IFooRepository wrapper — DbContext IS Unit-of-Work, DbSet<T> IS Repository), IMessageBus, ICatalogClient (gRPC port — substituted in tests), ILogger.\nDomain methods enforce invariants (Order.Create, order.MarkAsPaid). Money is calculated server-side, never trusted from client.\nMay cascade events (return an event → Wolverine publishes via outbox).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 200073,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 768624556,
      "isDeleted": false,
