    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "err_body",
      "x": 1220,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 541.40625,
      "height": 358.8,
      "text": "Anywhere a handler throws, this catches it and emits \nRFC 7807 ProblemDetails. Every response includes traceId so server-side logs \n+ client-reported errors connect.\n\n• ValidationException\n   → 400  Validation failed\n   + errors{} keyed by field\n\n• DbUpdateConcurrencyException\n   → 409  Concurrent modification\n   detail: 'Refetch and try again'\n\n• ArgumentException\n   → 400  Invalid request\n\n• InvalidOperationException\n   → 409  Operation not allowed\n   (e.g. order in wrong state for transition)\n\n• default (any other Exception)\n   → 500  An unexpected error occurred\n   detail: 'Please contact support with the trace ID'\n   (full details logged server-side, NEVER sent to client)",
      "originalText": "Anywhere a handler throws, this catches it and emits \nRFC 7807 ProblemDetails. Every response includes traceId so server-side logs \n+ client-reported errors connect.\n\n• ValidationException\n   → 400  Validation failed\n   + errors{} keyed by field\n\n• DbUpdateConcurrencyException\n   → 409  Concurrent modification\n   detail: 'Refetch and try again'\n\n• ArgumentException\n   → 400  Invalid request\n\n• InvalidOperationException\n   → 409  Operation not allowed\n   (e.g. order in wrong state for transition)\n\n• default (any other Exception)\n   → 500  An unexpected error occurred\n   detail: 'Please contact support with the trace ID'\n   (full details logged server-side, NEVER sent to client)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
