      "width": 1490.625,
      "height": 31.200000000000003,
      "text": "Files: NextAurora.ServiceDefaults/{Middleware/CorrelationIdMiddleware.cs, Messaging/ContextPropagationMiddleware.cs, GlobalExceptionHandler.cs, Extensions.cs}, each service's Program.cs + Endpoints/*.cs, \neach service's Features/*.cs. Related diagrams: 3 (transactional outbox detail), 4 (EF Core query + write lifecycle).",
